; INV-21 goldens: twins-reorder-a with the two entries swapped (synthetic data).
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2020-01-01 open Assets:Bank USD
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Food USD
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Snacks USD

; Same hash: the ordinal follows the line order, not the content.
2020-05-01 * "Kiosk" "snack"
  Expenses:Snacks   1.20 USD
  Assets:Bank      -1.20 USD

2020-05-01 * "Kiosk" "snack"
